# Pipeline scratch: raw fetches are large and reproducible within their window.
# Ledger, runs, snapshots, seen.json and web/public/data are durable state and stay tracked:
# CI starts from a fresh clone, so an untracked seen.json would re-judge (and re-pay for) old items.
data/raw/
data/audit/
*.tmp

